# --- Generated artifacts ---
# Unlike the v1 capstone (where these were graded deliverables that had to be
# committed), generated artifacts are rebuildable and do not belong in git.
# Databases come from the pipeline, models from the registry, indexes from ingestion.
*.db
*.sqlite3
*.joblib
models/
chroma_db/
data/chroma/
mlruns/
data/raw/
data/interim/
data/processed/
